{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1000_p", "source_sha256": "ed1ec272426f53566da005acbcb797b852bc0ef9b72481dd05006afd05ade9ce", "ja": "（今度の仕事は、バレンタインのキャンペーンモデル\n……衣装ももちろん、チョコレートがモチーフだ！）", "zh": "（这次的工作是情人节宣传活动的模特儿……\n服装当然是以巧克力为主题！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "32d34d4aae6721b748f848119b58143913310994081ae635d31872e3d18c0da0", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\n見てよ、この衣装！　かわいいだろ？", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n你快看这套服装！很可爱吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1002_p", "source_sha256": "28c83dfaa4b481e677526b895a1b99ae886b093c8b3fcdd48e51eac6d4fc3ae3", "ja": "お疲れさま、昴。\nああ、すごくかわいいな。似合ってるよ！", "zh": "昴，辛苦你了。\n是啊，非常可爱，很适合你喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1003_047sub", "source_sha256": "dcacbe7bc830bc0b11f1584fec6362703713eaf5cc7cacfa0ed2860a74c25b0e", "ja": "へへっ、サンキュ！　ちょっと照れるけど、\n似合ってるって言われると、やっぱうれしいな♪", "zh": "嘿嘿，谢啦！虽然有点害羞，\n但听你说很适合我，果然还是很高兴♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1004_047sub", "source_sha256": "97cd1216c101a181bbeb68bf24f3f90a617f0f236dda77fe25aeb611b7535ec6", "ja": "茜の衣装と、おそろいみたいだし……\n一緒にいると、きょうだいみたいだよな♪", "zh": "而且这套服装好像跟茜的一样……\n如果跟她站在一起就像是姊妹呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "4e584c3b74a81bcbf37884d6f4cf2c79f266d46c3378649d8bd86ae796991747", "ja": "でもさ、すっごくおいしそうに見えるけど、\n匂いとかしないんだ。不思議だよなー。", "zh": "不过啊，明明看起来超好吃的，\n却闻不到味道，这种感觉真奇怪呢──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1006_p", "source_sha256": "301cad064b10f52aa6cd2ae0363479b8f8d49ba21923d18b5f3fc0200097d264", "ja": "まあ、服だからな……でも確かに、茜の衣装も\n昴の衣装も、チョコレートみたいで美味しそうだな。", "zh": "毕竟是衣服嘛……但你说的没错，\n你跟茜的服装看起来都很像巧克力，感觉很好吃。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "566532aec49c8a1ac3052d62b2c8b7071a6d86e911dddd7af30cb041f364cf0d", "ja": "だろ？　ほんと、アイドルってすごいよなー。\nチョコはチョコでも、すっげーオシャレだもんな！", "zh": "对吧？偶像真的很厉害耶──\n即使像巧克力，也还是超时髦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1008_047sub", "source_sha256": "1d3b3c9abe860750c76f300ba992f37e26fec15b503714726ae897bfe57a371c", "ja": "オレ、チョコみたいな衣装だっていうから、\nどんなの来るんだろってヒヤヒヤしてたんだぜ！", "zh": "我之前听说是像巧克力一样的服装，\n不晓得会是什么样子，一直提心吊胆呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1009_p", "source_sha256": "6ceb9cce2eefbfea5863b85cf6b5c490bea6e2643a4d9b9943a3fc90f818e03f", "ja": "ヒヤヒヤ……って、どんな想像してたんだ？", "zh": "提心吊胆……你是想像了怎样的服装啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1010_047sub", "source_sha256": "b076a5848a9711bca4097892a4befc1d700a4a0a75345db65b4632f0ace46631", "ja": "チョコのボールとか、バット持つのかと思ってた。\nこの前ゲーセンで取ったチョコバーみたいなヤツ！", "zh": "我以为会拿着巧克力球或是球棒。\n就像之前在游戏中心拿到的巧克力棒一样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1011_047sub", "source_sha256": "ea893db9678fe69cc180cf94f76f1741b42e4ec567991e317dd1a31ed0b80b64", "ja": "そしたら、チョコの傘なんだもんなー。\nたいしたもんだ。", "zh": "结果搭配的是巧克力伞──\n真是没想到呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1012_p", "source_sha256": "e7b1960245c16662a6dacb0f5201c016e777187023efb0d95494de5eadd7d37a", "ja": "うん、流石にチョコのボールとバットはないかな。\n危ないし……というか、傘も振り回しちゃダメだぞ！", "zh": "嗯，再怎样也不会是巧克力球跟球棒吧。\n那太危险了……是说，雨伞也不能乱挥喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "171adc5e222cd4fbbb82e232900fd92319fa2ce1167731604ddff73de8a31209", "ja": "それくらい、わかってるって～。\n衣装なんだから、そんな危ないコトしないっての♪", "zh": "这点小事我当然知道～\n毕竟是服装配件，我不会做那么危险的事啦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1014_p", "source_sha256": "c6b1a1799d0021c6c9504ceb7337d39f876f9f7cff6d6ee985657d43c6564222", "ja": "そうか、それならいいんだけど……\nあ、チョコといえば……。", "zh": "这样啊，那就好……\n啊，说到巧克力……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1015_p", "source_sha256": "110532a37fb8e6117aacb597bba179ea4c94a51bb7d3ca6d64d4a02b55fd1299", "ja": "撮影に使うチョコの傘は、終わったら\n昴が持って帰っていいそうだ。よかったな。", "zh": "听说拍摄时用的巧克力伞，\n你可以在拍完后带回去。真是太好了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1016_047sub", "source_sha256": "15cbda6614cb2020e42b363f28300c8b214095b68e9f3c5c6b2aa26e3f1f5873", "ja": "え、あのチョコ、オレがもらっていいの！？\nやったー！　じゃあさ、劇場のみんなで食べようぜ！", "zh": "咦？我可以收下那个巧克力吗！？\n太好了──！那就跟剧场的大家一起分着吃吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1017_047sub", "source_sha256": "90cd2d1136c7a3a8d70035a6fc113587bc0cf0ac2b527f681c5ea9dae14ef00a", "ja": "でもさ、そうするとやっぱ、\n気になってくるよな……。", "zh": "不过啊，这么一来，\n还是会让我很好奇耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1018_p", "source_sha256": "813ed2305dc8f75e95e7c3018e7b255e1ae760fa25faebb40717528d8c9876b9", "ja": "昴？\n気になるって……何がだ？", "zh": "昴？\n你说好奇……是对什么好奇？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "b2ce679c7daf67d0041117bff29983aa917886d0064deaed99c024693588b4c0", "ja": "みんなで食べるなら、あのチョコ、\n割らないとだよな？　どれくらい硬いんだろ？", "zh": "既然要跟大家一起吃，\n就得剖开那个巧克力吧？但它有多硬呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1020_047sub", "source_sha256": "351f748dc4b6e70f80cdb8ead197c8fd27936dfd9af8ac23f8c965af1df243bf", "ja": "金属バットよりは柔らかそうだけど、\n木製バットくらいの硬さはありそうだよな……。", "zh": "感觉比金属球棒软，\n但应该跟木制球棒差不多硬……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1021_p", "source_sha256": "486c8f0e9377cf8cca6a6b377808282bf0123a848758d9830947185d31a24fdc", "ja": "昴、まさか……。\nだ、ダメだぞ！　それだけは！", "zh": "昴，你该不会……\n不、不可以！千万不能那么做！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1022_047sub", "source_sha256": "bb2317940c546b1174efdce8638c7830d630dd566b35f2c4b0b0b1a2d2de51b1", "ja": "やっぱ、チョコの傘で野球するしかないぜ！\nそれで割れたら、一石二鳥ってやつだよな♪", "zh": "果然还是一定要用巧克力伞打棒球！\n要是因此碎掉，就是一举两得了吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1023_047sub", "source_sha256": "b3573e8dd98b7ce7f730b82a0b360325131ae950b90e3c13b44699b593b357d1", "ja": "{$P$}！\nオレ、ボールないかちょっと探してくる！", "zh": "{$P$}！\n我去找看看有没有球！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_blst_047sub0094_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_047sub0094_1024_p", "source_sha256": "77499f4f50153983515a64348177d6dba5a8225ff0c2d6b76db4663e2ae65ece", "ja": "こら、昴！　話を聞いて……\n昴ー！", "zh": "喂，昴！听我说话……\n昴──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
